  "ms": {
    "finding": "Both calls reside in the same unwind-bounded function 82BBA0..82BD4E. 82BC1A invokes 771C00 with bool1; success sets local r15b. The routine performs an object operation at offset 0x214 and polls bit0. Its completion and timeout branches join at 82BD1B, which tests r15b then 82BD29 invokes 771C00 with bool0 before returning. The controller4 request is scoped to this internal operation; an external caller cannot hold it beyond that return through this path. This does not establish absence of other controls.",
    "next_requirement": "A different externally callable request with an independent owned lifetime is required; tracing callers of82BBA0 cannot turn this bounded operation into a lasting hold.",
